    "Interactive 6x6 texture walkthrough: JavaScript double-precision MC reconstruction, flat-bed Rusanov flux, donor draining, passive sediment transport, wall pressure and SSPRK2. Fully wet initial states, closed boundaries, fixed zero bed, no erosion/deposition or material updates. Each teaching request is 4 ms; stops rather than publishes if a request requires splitting or CFL rejection. These are computed teaching values, not captured GPU textures or a performance benchmark."
